# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Helm
charts/**/charts/
*.tgz

# Secrets — never commit; these come from the vault via ExternalSecret
*.pem
*.key
kubeconfig*

# Helm dependency artefacts.
#
# Every service chart depends on `file://../_library` in this same repo, so the
# vendored copy under `charts/` is a 37 KB tarball of a directory already
# tracked here — five identical duplicates that go stale the moment _library is
# edited. `Chart.lock` pins a digest of that same local path, so it churns on
# every library change and pins nothing a reader could not see.
#
# Both are rebuilt by `helm dependency update <chart>`, which the chart READMEs
# tell you to run before `helm template`.
deploy/charts/*/charts/
deploy/charts/*/Chart.lock
